  "Auto-update": "Автообновление",
  "Automated data quality and transformation capabilities for Dataform/dbt/BigQuery pipelines. Processes data sourced from BigQuery or Cloud Storage (GCS), applying best practices for data ingestion, movement, schema mapping, and comprehensive data cleaning.": "Автоматизированный контроль качества и преобразование данных для конвейеров Dataform/dbt/BigQuery. Обрабатывает данные из BigQuery или Cloud Storage (GCS), применяя лучшие практики очистки и трансформации данных.",
  "Automated data quality and transformation capabilities for Dataform/dbt/BigQuery\\n  pipelines. Processes data sourced from BigQuery or Cloud Storage (GCS), applying\\n  best practices for data ingestion, movement, schema mapping, and comprehensive data\\n  cleaning.": "Автоматизированный контроль качества и преобразование данных для конвейеров Dataform/dbt/BigQuery. Обрабатывает данные из BigQuery или Cloud Storage (GCS), применяя лучшие практики очистки и трансформации данных.",
  "Automates declarative resource creation and provisioning for data pipelines, supporting BigQuery, Dataform, Dataproc, BigQuery Data Transfer Service (DTS), and other resources. It manages environment-specific configurations (dev, staging, prod) through a deployment.yaml file. Use when: - Modifying or creating deployment.yaml for deployment settings. - Resolving environment-specific variables (e.g., Project IDs, Regions) for deployment. - Provisioning supported infrastructure like BigQuery datasets/tables, Dataform resources, or DTS resources via deployment.yaml. Do not use when: - Resources already exist. - Managing resources not supported by `gcloud beta orchestration-pipelines resource-types list`. - Managing general cloud infrastructure (VMs, networks, Kubernetes, IAM policies), which are better suited for Terraform. - Infrastructure spans multiple cloud providers (AWS, Azure, etc.). - Already uses Terraform for the target resources.": "Автоматизация декларативного создания и подготовки ресурсов для конвейеров данных (BigQuery, Dataform, Dataproc, DTS) через файл deployment.yaml.",
  "Automates declarative resource creation and provisioning for data pipelines, supporting BigQuery, Dataform, Dataproc, BigQuery Data Transfer Service (DTS), and other resources. It manages environment-specific configurations (dev, staging, prod) through a deployment.yaml file.\\n  Use when:\\n  - Modifying or creating deployment.yaml for deployment settings.\\n  - Resolving environment-specific variables (e.g., Project IDs, Regions) for deployment.\\n  - Provisioning supported infrastructure like BigQuery datasets/tables, Dataform resources, or DTS resources via deployment.yaml.\\n  Do not use when:\\n  - Resources already exist.\\n  - Managing resources not supported by `gcloud beta orchestration-pipelines resource-types list`.\\n  - Managing general cloud infrastructure (VMs, networks, Kubernetes, IAM policies), which are better suited for Terraform.\\n  - Infrastructure spans multiple cloud providers (AWS, Azure, etc.).\\n  - Already uses Terraform for the target resources.": "Автоматизация декларативного создания и подготовки ресурсов для конвейеров данных (BigQuery, Dataform, Dataproc, DTS) через файл deployment.yaml.",
  "Automatic Check for Updates": "Автопроверка обновлений",
  "Automatically expand the Changes Overview toolbar when the agent finishes generating a response.": "Автоматически раскрывать панель обзора изменений после завершения ответа агента.",
  "Automatically migrate legacy workflows to modern skills across global and workspace configurations. Scans for existing workflows, creates target SKILL.md files, and safely archives old workflow files.": "Автоматическая миграция устаревших рабочих процессов (workflows) на современные навыки (skills) в глобальных и рабочих конфигурациях с архивацией старых файлов.",
  "Automatically prompt you to restart the app when a new update is available.": "Автоматически предлагать перезапустить приложение при наличии нового обновления.",
  "Automatically prompt you to restart the app when a new update is available. When disabled, you can check for updates manually from the app menu.": "Автоматически предлагать перезапуск при наличии обновления. Если отключено, проверять обновления можно вручную в меню.",
